        "original_id": "c5fcce3e-b8f4-54c2-8e29-79686601b2f9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Operation Cold Comfort, World War II\n- Organizations: Special Air Service (SAS)\n- Places: Verona\n\nFacts:\n- The Special Air Service (SAS) was founded in 1941 as a regiment.\n- On February 17, 1945, during World War II, Operation Cold Comfort began with a parachute drop north of Verona.\n- Operation Cold Comfort was a failed SAS raid.\n- The Special Air Service (SAS) was later reconstituted as a corps in 1950.",
